codex
I’m testing a more targeted variance reduction: propagate samples through all but the final layer, then estimate the final ReLU mean from the sampled final pre-activation mean and variance using a Gaussian moment formula. The last pre-activation is a wide weighted sum, so this approximation may trade a little bias for lower sample noise.
